(Inv)\"]\n    E004[\"E004 Cleanup semantics (Inv)\"]\n    E010[\"E010 repo-onboarding kagenti-operator\"]\n    E011[\"E11 repo-onboarding kagenti-extensions\"]\n    E012[\"E012 license-validation kagenti-operator\"]\n    E013[\"E013 license-validation kagenti-extensions\"]\n    E014[\"E014 Konflux onboarding kagenti-operator image\"]\n    E015[\"E015 Konflux onboarding AuthBridge proxy image\"]\n    E020[\"E020 KagentiOperator DSC component controller\"]\n    E021[\"E021 OLM/CSV packaging\"]\n    E030[\"E030 Dashboard BFF plugin + feature flag\"]\n    E040[\"E040 QE E2E lifecycle + disconnected validation\"]\n    E050[\"E050 Documentation (docs-authoring)\"]\n\n    E010 --> E014\n    E011 --> E015\n    E004 --> E020\n    E020 --> E021\n    E003 --> E030\n    E020 --> E040\n    E021 --> E040\n    E001 --> E050\n    E010 --> E050\n    E011 --> E050\n    E012 --> E050\n    E013 --> E050\n    E014 --> E050\n    E015 --> E050\n    E020 --> E050\n    E021 --> E050\n    E030 --> E050\n    E040 --> E050\n\n    BA[\"BRANCH-A-E016 Upstream gap remediation (conditional)\"]\n    BB[\"BRANCH-B-E017 Additional AuthBridge variants (conditional)\"]\n    E001 -.-> BA\n    E002 -.-> BB\n```\n\nSolid edges are main-plan dependencies (dependency must complete before dependent starts).\nDashed edges are conditional branch activations: the branch epic exists only if the gating\nInvestigation resolves to the outcome that requires it.\n\n## DAG Justification\n\n| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| E010 → E014 | Rule 5 (repo-onboarding → konflux-onboarding serial) | The Konflux component builds from the opendatahub-io midstream fork; the pipeline needs the repo. |\n| E011 → E015 | Rule 5 | Same: the AuthBridge proxy image builds from the kagenti-extensions midstream fork. |\n| E004 → E020 | Rule 3 (Investigation gates affected Implementation) | Whether component cleanup includes cross-namespace CRD deletion or documents orphan semantics changes the controller's cleanup/finali