ables — measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running with images from the mirror registry\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- [P1] OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":70579,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba13640ea0c9c49d","agent_id":"a13c4baab7f592a79","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"68b2d7a2-dfe6-44c4-bd91-65123cf91017","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:13:44.666Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8006 into epics"}
