{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba0c1628ddc5157a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n3\ttitle: Determine the AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tinvestigation_signals:\n10\t  question_specificity: 1\n11\t  source_accessibility: 0\n12\t  local_runnability: 0\n13\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: 0\n14\t  human_judgment_required: -2\n15\timplementation_type: null\n16\tdependencies: []\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: -1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Determine the AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis investigation decides which AuthBridge sidecar image variants ship in Tech Preview. Upstream kagenti-extensions provides three variants — `authbridge-proxy` (full proxy, default mode), `authbridge-envoy` (Envoy ext_proc mode), and `authbridge-lite` (auth-only) — and each variant requires its own Konflux component. The strategy commits only to `authbridge-proxy` as the minimum viable set for TP; whether the other variants are needed for the 3.5 release is an open product question owned jointly by the Kagenti team and PM. The deliverable is a recorded decision that fixes the Konflux onboarding scope.\n30\t\n31\t## Scope\n32\t\n33\t- Decide, with PM input, whether Tech Preview ships `authbridge-proxy` only, or also includes `authbridge-envoy` and/or `authbridge-lite`\n34\t- For each additional variant included, define the Konflux component scope (same FIPS/UBI9 recipe as the proxy variant) and the `RELATED_IMAGE_*` CSV entries it requires\n35\t- Record the decision with rationale, including the deferral plan for any variant excluded from TP\n36\t\n37\t## Acceptance Criteria\n38\t\n39\t- A decision record exists naming the exact AuthBridge variant set for Tech Preview, with PM sign-off and rationale\n40\t- If variants beyond `authbridge-proxy` are included, the per-variant Konflux component scope is enumerated; if excluded, the deferral (later release) is recorded\n41\t\n42\t## HLR Traceability\n43\t\n44\tNo HLR is directly delivered. This investigation fixes the scope of the P1 HLR \"AuthBridge\n45\tproxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance\" and determines whether additional\n46\tvariant-onboarding work (deferred, lower-priority) must be planned.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6132f1409369405","agent_id":"a7fb7d5324fc4e6ec","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"3e31c76d-3ac1-4a80-8d07-d4e6e33c100f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:27:59.201Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba0c1628ddc5157a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
