d midstream-only\n40\t- Identify the initial pinned commit of the fork that downstream consumers (build pipeline, component manifests) will reference\n41\t\n42\t## Acceptance Criteria\n43\t\n44\t- The `opendatahub-io/kagenti-operator` midstream fork exists and its content is synced with the upstream repository at an identifiable pinned commit\n45\t- The fork sync process is documented and repeatable\n46\t- The upstream-first contribution workflow is documented for the Kagenti team\n47\t\n48\t## HLR Traceability\n49\t\n50\t- [P0] Upstream-first policy: significant changes go to `kagenti/*` repos before being pulled into `opendatahub-io/*` midstream forks (RFE acceptance criterion)\n51\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6132f1409369405","agent_id":"a7fb7d5324fc4e6ec","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"c815d818-6578-4242-a262-542b5c206b4d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:28:03.949Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-99c61b4ca1dd27a2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
