registries), enabling air-gapped operation with image mirroring\n42\t\n43\t## Acceptance Criteria\n44\t\n45\t- The CSV declares the `KagentiOperator` CRD and the component controller RBAC\n46\t- The CSV carries SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` and `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` entries (pinned digests available — configuration reference gate on the image builds, not a schedule dependency)\n47\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring, when the kagenti-operator component is `Managed`, then the operator and AuthBridge images resolve from the mirrored registry via `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables — measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running with images from the mirror registry\n48\t\n49\t## HLR Traceability\n50\t\n51\t- [P1] OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6132f1409369405","agent_id":"a7fb7d5324fc4e6ec","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"67e9e512-1437-48a8-89b2-f60bd488fbab","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:28:10.460Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9469dfe66aa68def","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
