{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e0deb77017b2b16","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E011\n3\ttitle: Establish the kagenti-extensions midstream fork under opendatahub-io\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\timplementation_type: repo-onboarding\n10\tdependencies: null\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 1\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: 1\n17\t  external_dependency: 1\n18\t  human_process_gates: -1\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 0\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 5\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Establish the kagenti-extensions midstream fork under opendatahub-io\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic establishes (or verifies and repairs) the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork of the upstream `kagenti/kagenti-extensions` repository, which provides the AuthBridge sidecar images. The AuthBridge Konflux builds target this fork. Unlike the operator fork, the strategy's dependency table does not confirm this fork's state, so creation may be required.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Verify the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork exists and is synced with upstream `kagenti/kagenti-extensions`; create it if absent\n38\t- Establish and document the fork sync process (how upstream releases/commits are pulled into midstream)\n39\t- Document the upstream-first contribution workflow: significant changes land in the `kagenti/kagenti-extensions` upstream repo first, then are pulled into the midstream fork\n40\t- Identify the initial pinned commit of the fork that the AuthBridge image builds will reference\n41\t\n42\t## Acceptance Criteria\n43\t\n44\t- The `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork exists and its content is synced with the upstream repository at an identifiable pinned commit\n45\t- The fork sync process is documented and repeatable\n46\t- The upstream-first contribution workflow is documented for the Kagenti team\n47\t\n48\t## HLR Traceability\n49\t\n50\t- [P0] Upstream-first policy: significant changes go to `kagenti/*` repos before being pulled into `opendatahub-io/*` midstream forks (RFE acceptance criterion) — supports the P1 AuthBridge build HLR's upstream source\n51\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-80d8b2e2dbd4618f","agent_id":"a718a47f9410d0a38","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"2572230a-be32-4205-a29c-e500dc7ae393","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:35:11.330Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e0deb77017b2b16","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-8006"}
