irmed and recorded\n45\t- A transitive-dependency license scan has been executed over the midstream fork's locked dependency set, with results recorded\n46\t- Any flagged dependencies have a documented remediation path\n47\t- The license clearance record is submitted for the pending human review gate\n48\t\n49\t## HLR Traceability\n50\t\n51\tNo numbered HLR covers licensing directly. This epic closes the strategy's Licence Validation\n52\tprerequisite (pending human review) for the kagenti-operator repository, a mandatory part of\n53\tthe onboarding chain for a component not yet in the platform, and de-risks the P0\n54\tKonflux-built operator image HLR.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-938922a3c6f81d8a","agent_id":"aaab2f6cf940fe815","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"22d8ea0a-f373-4986-81f1-b6cc31a2c11e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:38:47.167Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-96b5ae3ee0b9c317","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review after second revision"}
