{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e67f8d5b5411fd9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E021\n3\ttitle: OLM/CSV packaging for kagenti-operator with disconnected-install support\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Platform\n6\tteam: Platform / ODH Operator\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E020\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 7\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n29\tgate_failure_impact:\n30\t  action: rewrite\n31\t  fallback_approach: The AuthBridge variant-set decision fixes which RELATED_IMAGE_*\n32\t    entries the CSV carries. If Tech Preview ships authbridge-proxy only, the additional-variant\n33\t    entries are not added; if additional variants are included, a SHA256-pinned RELATED_IMAGE_*\n34\t    entry is added for each, consuming the pinned references published by the additional-variant\n35\t    Konflux onboarding work.\n36\t---\n37\t# OLM/CSV packaging for kagenti-operator with disconnected-install support\n38\t\n39\t## Description\n40\t\n41\tThis epic adds kagenti-operator to the ClusterServiceVersion (CSV) with SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries so the component installs disconnected/air-gapped via OLM relatedImages and image mirroring. It declares the new `KagentiOperator` CRD in the CSV and includes the RBAC the component controller needs to manage kagenti-operator resources. This epic owns the `RELATED_IMAGE_*` CSV entries for all AuthBridge variants: the committed minimum (`authbridge-proxy`) unconditionally, and any additional variants the Tech Preview variant-set decision includes, consuming the SHA256-pinned references published by the additional-variant Konflux onboarding work.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Add `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` (kagenti-operator image, SHA256-pinned) and `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` (AuthBridge proxy sidecar image, SHA256-pinned) environment variable entries to the CSV; add a `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entry for each additional AuthBridge variant if, and only if, the Tech Preview variant-set decision includes it, consuming the SHA256-pinned reference published by that variant's Konflux onboarding work\n46\t- Declare the `KagentiOperator` CRD in the CSV\n47\t- Add RBAC rules to the CSV for the component controller to manage kagenti-operator resources\n48\t- Ensure image references resolve through `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables at deploy time (never hardcoded registries), enabling air-gapped operation with image mirroring\n49\t\n50\t## Acceptance Criteria\n51\t\n52\t- The CSV declares the `KagentiOperator` CRD and the component controller RBAC\n53\t- The CSV carries SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` and `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` entries (pinned digests available — configuration reference gate on the image builds, not a schedule dependency)\n54\t- If the Tech Preview variant set includes AuthBridge variants beyond `authbridge-proxy`, the CSV carries a SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entry for each additional variant (pinned digests available — configuration reference gate on the additional-variant image builds, not a schedule dependency); if the set is proxy-only, no additional entries are present\n55\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring, when the kagenti-operator component is `Managed`, then the operator and AuthBridge images resolve from the mirrored registry via `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables — measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running with images from the mirror registry\n56\t\n57\t## HLR Traceability\n58\t\n59\t- [P1] OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-938922a3c6f81d8a","agent_id":"aaab2f6cf940fe815","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"e4edd746-24bf-4db1-b1ea-1389370beb1f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:38:54.316Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e67f8d5b5411fd9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review after second revision"}
