{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-965aa589a1f944fa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-BRANCH-B-E017\n3\ttitle: Konflux onboarding for additional AuthBridge sidecar variants\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P2\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tbranch: B\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n12\tdependencies:\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n14\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E011\n15\tgate_failure_impact:\n16\t  action: remove\n17\t  fallback_approach: Activated only if the Tech Preview variant set includes AuthBridge\n18\t    variants beyond authbridge-proxy. If TP ships proxy-only, this epic is dropped\n19\t    and the additional variants defer to a later release.\n20\tai_signals:\n21\t  change_specificity: 1\n22\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n23\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n24\t  existing_foundation: 1\n25\t  open_questions: 1\n26\t  external_dependency: 0\n27\t  human_process_gates: -1\n28\t  repo_access: 1\n29\t  architecture_claims: 1\n30\tinvestigation_signals: null\n31\tai_implementability: High\n32\tai_implementability_score: 6\n33\tjira_key: null\n34\t---\n35\t# Konflux onboarding for additional AuthBridge sidecar variants\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tThis conditional epic exists only if the Tech Preview variant-set decision includes AuthBridge sidecars beyond the default `authbridge-proxy`. It onboards the required additional variants — `authbridge-envoy` (Envoy ext_proc mode) and/or `authbridge-lite` (auth-only) — as separate Konflux components built from the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork, using the same FIPS/UBI9 recipe as the proxy variant, and publishes the SHA256-pinned image references for each included variant. The `RELATED_IMAGE_*` CSV entries that consume those references are owned by the OLM/CSV packaging epic for kagenti-operator, which is gated on the same variant-set decision — this epic does not modify the CSV.\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- For each variant included in the Tech Preview set per the variant-set decision: create a Konflux component building from the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork\n44\t- Convert each variant's Dockerfile to the multi-stage FIPS pattern (`CGO_ENABLED=1`, `GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`, builder stage; `ubi9/ubi-minimal` production stage), with `rpms.lock.yaml` and `go.sum`\n45\t- Apply the platform container security pattern to each variant image (non-root, dropped capabilities, RuntimeDefault seccomp)\n46\t- Validate each variant image passes Konflux `check-payload` FIPS validation\n47\t- Publish the SHA256-pinned image references for each included variant for consumption by the OLM/CSV packaging work; the `RELATED_IMAGE_*` CSV entries themselves are owned by the OLM/CSV packaging epic, not added here\n48\t\n49\t## Acceptance Criteria\n50\t\n51\t- Each variant included in the Tech Preview set has a Konflux component with a green build pipeline\n52\t- Each variant image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for FIPS compliance\n53\t- Each variant's Dockerfile follows the multi-stage FIPS pattern with lockfiles present, and container security requirements are satisfied\n54\t- SHA256-pinned image references for all included variants are published for consumption by the OLM/CSV packaging epic\n55\t\n56\t## HLR Traceability\n57\t\n58\t- Extends the [P1] AuthBridge sidecar image HLR to the additional variants required for Tech Preview\n59\t- [P2] Multi-arch builds (AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if pipeline supports it without additional effort)\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-938922a3c6f81d8a","agent_id":"aaab2f6cf940fe815","session_id":"e32792c3-9f26-4396-a9d5-fe6ebf0cdb37","uuid":"8e1b3185-123c-4c2c-9de2-71cec5a7cbaf","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:38:59.800Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-965aa589a1f944fa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"con